OL,3,GNEWSAMan not guilty of attempted murder
OL,4,Aafter shooting
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 25-year-old man has been found not
OL,7,Fguilty of attempted murder in
OL,8,Fconnection with a shooting.
OL,10,FWilliam Scammell, from Speedwell in
OL,11,FBristol, pulled up alongside Ryan
OL,12,FCridland's car and fired a sawn-off
OL,13,Fshotgun through his window on 1 April.
OL,14,FThe 24-year-old suffered serious chest
OL,15,Finjuries in the attack and was taken to
OL,16,Fhospital for urgent surgery.
OL,18,FThe jury at Bristol Crown Crown
OL,19,Freturned a guilty verdict for the
OL,20,Flesser charge possession of a firearm
OL,21,Fwith intent to endanger life earlier.
OL,23,APub: 14-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,342,340,200,160,0,100
