OL,3,GNEWSAMan not guilty of attempted murder
OL,4,Aafter shooting
OL,5,
OL,6,FDet Ch Insp Jess Aston, from Avon and
OL,7,FSomerset Police, said: "This was a
OL,8,Fserious and concerning incident, and
OL,9,Ftoday's outcome reflects the gravity of
OL,10,Fthe offending."
